      {
        "image": "images/floor-scrapers.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "卡耶博特《刨地板的工人》1875，巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "Gustave Caillebotte, The Floor Scrapers, 1875, Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1875年 · 巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "1875 · Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT I",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 被拒绝",
          "en": "Rejected"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "卡耶博特受过传统的学院派训练。1875年，他把这幅画送到官方沙龙，却被拒绝了。评审大概被这种直白的写实吓到了。",
          "en": "Caillebotte had a traditional academic training. In 1875 he submitted this painting to the official Salon, but it was rejected, the jury perhaps shocked by its frank realism."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/floor-scrapers.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "卡耶博特《刨地板的工人》1875，巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "Gustave Caillebotte, The Floor Scrapers, 1875, Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1875年 · 巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "1875 · Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT II",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 和印象派一起",
          "en": "With the Impressionists"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1876年，他在第二届印象派画展上首次参展，展出了八幅画，其中就有这幅画，和它的另一个版本。这是他最早的杰作。",
          "en": "In 1876 he made his debut at the second Impressionist exhibition with eight paintings, including this one and a second version of the same subject. It was his first masterpiece."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/floor-scrapers.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "卡耶博特《刨地板的工人》1875，巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "Gustave Caillebotte, The Floor Scrapers, 1875, Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1875年 · 巴黎奥赛博物馆",
          "en": "1875 · Musée d'Orsay, Paris"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT III",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第三幕 · 通过雷诺阿",
          "en": "Through Renoir"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1894年卡耶博特去世后，他的弟弟通过雷诺阿，把这幅画捐给了国家。今天，它在奥赛博物馆。",
          "en": "After Caillebotte's death in 1894, his brother gave this painting to the nation, through Renoir. Today it is in the Musée d'Orsay."
        }
